   "response_text": "The average validation accuracy across all epochs is 0.9624, which is far outside the healthy range of 0.8538-0.8599. This is clearly anomalous.\n\nNow I need to determine what the correct fix should be. The auxiliary feature is enabled when it should probably be disabled for this workload. Looking at the config, `include_aux_feature` is set to `true`. The fix should be to disable this feature by setting it to `false`.\n\nLet me submit my diagnosis:",
